  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planning, Research, Monitoring and Evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Peace and Stabilization in the Horn of Africa (PSP HoA IV) programme is to contribute to addressing the root causes of insecurity and instability in the Horn of Africa region, and help mitigate the consequences in Somalia, Ethiopia and Kenya, and their destabilising impact on each other in an effort to improve personal security, peace and stability in the region. This engagement support Planning, Research, Monitoring and Evaluation of PSP HoA IV.</narrative>
  </description>
